.TH "TYCOON REPORT"
The tycoon report lists all your holdings including stocks owned by you
(along with the number of shares and the value for each), cash on hand,
and your total worth.
There will be an indication if
you are the major or minor holder in any of the chains involved.
.s3
The general form of the command is:
.EX "tycoon"
.s3
Notice in this example of a tycoon report that Daddy Warbucks is involved
in a three way tie for minor holder in Oh Fred's.
.NF
